WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:16.681
Brad: Why did the mites give Chuck and Dave to those ants?

2
00:00:16.682 --> 00:00:19.752
Danny: It looked like the ants paid for the bullies.

3
00:00:19.753 --> 00:00:22.747
Brad: So what are we going to do now?

4
00:00:22.748 --> 00:00:30.582
Danny: I guess we have to follow the ants.

5
00:00:30.583 --> 00:00:32.852
Danny: They’re coming back.

6
00:00:32.853 --> 00:00:35.156
Brad: Quick, hide!

7
00:00:35.157 --> 00:00:37.598
Danny: We have to find a way out of here.

8
00:00:37.599 --> 00:00:41.510
Brad: I think that’s going to be difficult.

9
00:00:41.511 --> 00:00:46.554
Danny: I’ll check if the coast is clear.

10
00:00:46.555 --> 00:00:48.878
Brad: Can you see anything?

11
00:00:48.879 --> 00:00:51.193
Danny: There’s something happening by the gate.

12
00:00:51.194 --> 00:00:54.568
Brad: What?

13
00:00:54.569 --> 00:00:57.041
Danny: What are they doing?

14
00:00:57.042 --> 00:01:00.828
Brad: They are opening the gate.

15
00:01:00.829 --> 00:01:03.398
Danny: I think someone is coming in.

16
00:01:03.399 --> 00:01:08.971
Brad: Maybe the ants are bringing the bullies back.

17
00:01:08.972 --> 00:01:12.254
Brad: Look, all the mites are gathering at the gate.

18
00:01:12.255 --> 00:01:18.419
Danny: They look excited about something.

19
00:01:18.420 --> 00:01:21.541
Brad: I can’t see any mites anywhere else.

20
00:01:21.542 --> 00:01:27.671
Brad: Maybe now is a good time to try to escape.

21
00:01:27.672 --> 00:01:29.977
Danny: No. Something is up.

22
00:01:29.978 --> 00:01:33.369
It’s something important.

23
00:01:33.370 --> 00:01:35.539
Brad: How do you know that?

24
00:01:35.540 --> 00:01:37.770
Danny: It’s just a feeling.

25
00:01:37.771 --> 00:01:44.498
Brad: My feeling is that we should make a run for it!

26
00:01:44.499 --> 00:01:47.444
Brad: They’re happy about something.

27
00:01:47.445 --> 00:01:54.399
Danny: What could possibly make a mite happy?

28
00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:56.781
Brad: Oh my gosh!

29
00:01:56.782 --> 00:02:00.664
Danny: I . . . I don’t understand!

30
00:02:00.665 --> 00:02:02.736
Brad: It’s Hopian!

31
00:02:02.737 --> 00:02:04.421
Danny: And Tina!

32
00:02:04.422 --> 00:02:07.147
Brad: How did Tina find Hopian?

33
00:02:07.148 --> 00:02:11.400
Danny: And how did they both get here?

34
00:02:11.401 --> 00:02:14.045
Bello: What are we going to do, Tina?

35
00:02:14.046 --> 00:02:16.001
Tina: I’m thinking, Bello.

36
00:02:16.002 --> 00:02:19.006
We have to escape somehow.

37
00:02:19.007 --> 00:02:21.889
Bello: But there are so many of them.

38
00:02:21.890 --> 00:02:26.583
Tina: My guess is that they aren’t as smart as us.

39
00:02:26.584 --> 00:02:30.690
This must be their fort.

40
00:02:30.691 --> 00:02:34.902
Bello: Those walls are very high.

41
00:02:34.903 --> 00:02:38.349
Tina: Wait! Look up there!

42
00:02:38.350 --> 00:02:40.206
Bello: That’s Brad and Danny!

43
00:02:40.207 --> 00:02:43.007
They look just like I remember.

44
00:02:43.008 --> 00:02:44.883
Tina: What are they doing here?

45
00:02:44.884 --> 00:02:48.107
Tina: I thought they shrunk the bullies, not themselves.

46
00:02:48.108 --> 00:02:53.312
Bello: It looks like they are prisoners too.

47
00:02:53.313 --> 00:02:55.663
Tina: I’ve got an idea.

48
00:02:55.664 --> 00:02:58.094
Look up there in the tower!

49
00:02:58.095 --> 00:03:01.742
Tina: I think they’re trying to escape!

50
00:03:01.743 --> 00:03:03.582
Danny: Why is she doing that?

51
00:03:03.583 --> 00:03:05.751
Brad: I don’t know, but look out!

52
00:03:05.752 --> 00:03:08.837
The mites are all coming this way.

53
00:03:08.838 --> 00:03:16.104
Danny: That Tina! She’s nothing but trouble!
